<section class="science-section wf-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="science-wrapper">
      <img
        src="//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0254/3170/3629/files/icon-quote-1.svg"
        loading="lazy"
        alt=""
        class="science-quote-image"
      >
      <div class="science-quote-wrapper">
        <div class="science-quote-text">
          “IceBeanie should not only be in every household freezer, but every sports locker room across the country.”<br>
        </div>
        <div class="science-quote-author">Dr. Erlingsson MD MPH</div>
        <div class="science-quote-school">Harvard Medical</div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="science-heading">The Science is Simple</h2>
      <div class="science-sub-heading">Cold Therapy Effects You In Three Different Ways:</div>
      <div class="science-list-wrapper">
        <div id="w-node-f2438677-e543-fb75-014d-51d16e6eebc5-c6655e19" class="science-list-item">
          <img
            src="//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0254/3170/3629/files/metabolic-system.png"
            loading="lazy"
            alt="Metabolic System"
            class="science-list-item-icon"
          >
          <div class="science-list-item-title">Metabolic System</div>
          <p class="science-list-item-text">The cold slows down oxygen demand which slows down pain signaling</p>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_6ab2adb5-a500-fb59-58a7-13d9490381fd-c6655e19" class="science-list-item">
          <img
            src="//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0254/3170/3629/files/circulatory-system.png"
            loading="lazy"
            alt="Circulatory System"
            class="science-list-item-icon"
          >
          <div class="science-list-item-title">Circulatory System</div>
          <p class="science-list-item-text">
            Restricts blood flow. Less blood to brain vessels prevents painful overextending
          </p>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_432af9f6-2cd4-e227-79d9-00f45f6ba212-c6655e19" class="science-list-item">
          <img
            src="//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0254/3170/3629/files/nervous-system.png"
            loading="lazy"
            alt="Nervous System"
            class="science-list-item-icon"
          >
          <div class="science-list-item-title">Nervous System</div>
          <p class="science-list-item-text">
            Cold slows down the speed at which nerves travel. So it’s harder for pain signals to reach your brain
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


